# ── Claude AI ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com — without it, the AI chat shows
# a friendly fallback message but every other feature works fine.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: override the default model.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# ── Unsplash photography ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Get an Access Key at https://unsplash.com/developers.
#
# With a key, dish photos are pulled from the official Unsplash search API
# (higher quality, content-filtered, attribution-tracked, cached 24h).
# Without it, the /api/image route falls back to source.unsplash.com so
# you still get real photos — never placeholders.
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=

# ── Cloudinary (your AI-generated dish photography) ─────────────────────
# When you've produced custom photos (Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, your own
# camera, etc.) and uploaded them to Cloudinary, set your cloud name here.
# Then in src/data/menu.ts replace `img(...)` with `cloudinary('menu/<id>')`.
# Example: NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD=anubis-restaurant
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD=

# ── Firebase Storage (alternative custom-photo host) ────────────────────
# Use this if you prefer Firebase. Bucket name including the suffix.
# Example: NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_BUCKET=anubis-restaurant.appspot.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_BUCKET=
